flowchart LR
    A[NYC TLC landing page\nHTML catalog] --> M[Source manifest\nCSV + source registry JSON]
    B[Yellow / HVFHV dictionaries\nPDF definitions] --> M
    M --> D[Monthly Parquet files\n4 service types × selected months]
    D --> S[Local source cache\ndata/raw + SHA-256]
    S --> I[Inspect stage\nmetadata + schema + pickup column]
    I --> Q{Quality gates}
    Q -- fail --> F[FAILED run\nquality_report.json + log]
    Q -- pass --> C[Curate stage\ncommon contract: service × month]
    C --> O[data/curated\nmonthly + half-year CSV]
    O --> R[Reports\nquality + metrics JSON]
    R --> V[Run evidence\nruns/latest.json + log]
    O --> A2[Analysis-ready\nranking + sensitivity check]
